# Physical_mods - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_!lalt|search.kbd)
**!lctl|select + spc**        -- Select File (C-A-o)
**!lctl|select + lsft + spc** -- Select Folder (C-S-o)
**!lctl|select + a**          -- Select All Text (ggVG)
**!lctl|select + b**          -- Bold Text (C-A-b)
**!lctl|select + e**          -- Toggle Edit Mode (C-A-e)
**!lctl|select + p**          -- Select Files
**!lctl|select + r**          -- Toggle Source Mode (C-A-S-e)
**!lctl|select + ,**          -- Setting
**!lctl|select + lsft + p**   -- Commands (C-A-p)
**lctl + tab**                -- Walk Through Apps
**lctl + `**                  -- Walk Through Same App
**lctl + b**                  -- Page Up
**lctl + f**                  -- Page Down
**lctl + t**                  -- New Tab (A-C-t)
**lctl + ,**                  -- Setting
**lctl + ;**                  -- Vimola (C-A-M-e [50ms] ;)
**lctl + [**                  -- Forward (C-A-right)
**lctl + ]**                  -- Backward (C-A-left)
**lctl + lsft + t**           -- Undo Close Tab (A-C-S-t)
